### Create
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test task",
  "date": "2026-10-06"
}

### List
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### Mark as done (paste the id from Create)
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/684e9088-aa72-4458-bbd9-e21989031be6

### Delete (same id)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tasks/684e9088-aa72-4458-bbd9-e21989031be6

### List again
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks

### Bad date → should be 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "date": "hello" }

### Bad id → should be 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/abc

### Valid uuid that doesn't exist → should be 404 NOT_FOUND
PUT http://localhost:3000/tasks/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000